### Side to side for better graphical view (run please)

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: -50, vertical-margin: 200}
,,,ide python
```
#!/usr/bin/env python3
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import numpy as np

x = np.linspace(0, 10, 100)
y = np.sin(x)

plt.plot(x, y, 'b-', linewidth=2)
plt.title('Simple Sinus')
plt.xlabel('x')
plt.ylabel('sin(x)')
plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)
plt.show()
```
 output : "python-output-2",,,
:::

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: 500, vertical-margin: 200}
output : "python-output-2"
:::

