### Handle Javascript and SQL too !

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: -50, vertical-margin: 130}
,,,ide javascript
```
#!/usr/bin/env node

function fibonacci(n) {
  if (n <= 1) return n;
  return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);
}

for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
  console.log(`F(${i}) = ${fibonacci(i)}`);
}
```
output : "javascript-output",,,
:::

